(text "J1: computer power/data or charger power. USB_GND is never tied to scoring GND.\nU18 uses external 3.3V on both sides; 1uF + 100nF bypass on each side. PIN is enabled by CORE_3V3.\nPower qualification and isolated supply are separate from this interface. This sheet does not certify USB/FIE compliance." (at 25.4 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 77388526-fa02-49ac-82a3-0db8f0556a13))
